scenario a good fix goes stale rather than staying good
describe Freshness is decided before quality. An excellent fix from ten minutes
describe ago is not a slightly worse fix: the wearer may have walked anywhere
describe since, so it is a circle whose radius nobody measured.

at 0
  fix 3d
  pos 5000000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3000
  sats 12 15
  hdop 80
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect validity valid
  expect trust trusted

# The receiver goes quiet. The same observation, re-examined later, is a
# different answer — nothing about the fix changed, only the time.
at 29000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3000
  sats 12 15
  hdop 80
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect validity valid

at 45000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3000
  sats 12 15
  hdop 80
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect validity valid            # the observation's own timestamp is current

at 60000
  fix none
  sats 0 3
  expect validity nofix
  expect reason fix-lost
